Section 32 of the principal Order is amended -

(a) in subsection (I), by deleting "Minister" from the fourth line and by

(b) in subsection (4) - (i] by deleting "Minister" from the third line and by substituting "Attorney General" therefor; [ii) in paragraph (a), by deleting "Minister" from the first line and by (iiij in paragraph (b), by deleting "Minister" from the first line and by

(iv) in paragraph (c), by deleting "Minister" from the first line and the third last line and by substituting "Attorney General" therefor; (v] in paragraph (dl, by deleting "Minister" from the second line and by substituting "Attorney General" therefor;

(c) in subsection (5), by deleting "Minister" from the first line and the last line and by substituting "Attorney General" therefor;

(d) in subsection (61, in paragraph (b), by deleting "Minister" wherever it appears and by substituting "Attorney General" therefor.

Section 101 of the principal Order is amended -

(a) in subsection (I), by deleting "Minister" and by substituting "Attorney General" therefor;

(b) in subsection (2), in paragraph (a), by deleting "Minister" and by substituting "Attorney General" therefor.
